                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/2166: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">at
                        Geneva</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-04-04T17:00:00-05:00">April 4, 1934—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>136. Your 232, March 29, 1 p.m. Your paragraph 5. We are asking Gibson to make
                    this suggestion. We of course assume that the Secretariat is requesting the
                    Brazilian representative on the Advisory Committee to obtain this
                    information.</p>
                <p>Your paragraph 6. We do not desire to express any opinion at this moment on the
                    three questions mentioned.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
